## Why This Is Asked
Tests native module design, cross‑platform background work, and cache policy in a realistic streaming app.

## Key Concepts
- React Native bridge (JSI/TurboModules) and eventing
- Desktop-like background downloads on mobile (WorkManager/URLSession)
- Per-episode LRU cache with quotas and resilience to partial chunks
- Minimal, ergonomic JS API and a useOfflineEpisode hook

## Code Example
```javascript
// JS sketch
function useOfflineEpisode(epId) {
  const [state, setState] = useState({status:'idle', progress:0});
  useEffect(() => {
    OfflineMedia.onState(epId, s => setState(s));
  }, [epId]);
  return { ...state, start: () => OfflineMedia.startDownload(epId) };
}
```

